.TH GHOST-DL 1 "2026-10-22" "ghost-dl 2.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ghost-dl \- download game OSTs from KHInsider
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ghost-dl
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIINPUT\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ghost-dl
downloads albums from the Kingdom Hearts Insider game soundtrack archive
(https://downloads.khinsider.com).
.PP
\fIINPUT\fR may be an album URL, an album slug, or a batch file of URLs/slugs
(one per line). With no \fIINPUT\fR, the search TUI is opened.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS General
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-tui
Open the search TUI.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-search " " \fIQUERY\fR
Search albums and print results.
.TP
.BR \-i ", " \-\-info
Show album info without downloading.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-dry\-run
Resolve files but do not download.
.SS Download
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIDIR\fR
Output directory (default: current directory).
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-threads " " \fIN\fR
Parallel workers (default: CPU/2, max 8).
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format " " \fIFMT\fR
Audio format, or a comma-separated preference list (for example
.BR flac,mp3 ).
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-default ", " \-y ", " \-\-yes
Pick the highest quality format without prompting.
.TP
.BR \-T ", " \-\-tracks " " \fILIST\fR
Only download the listed tracks, by their position in the album as shown by
.BR \-\-info .
\fILIST\fR is a comma-separated list of numbers and ranges, for example
.BR 1\-5,8,12\- .
.TP
.B \-\-playlist
Write
.I playlist.m3u8
into the album folder.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-cover
Skip album art.
.TP
.B \-\-cover\-only
Download only album art.
.TP
.B \-\-force
Re-download files that already exist.
.SS Logging
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Suppress progress and log messages.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Show extra log messages.
.SH DOWNLOADS
Files are written as
.IR NAME .part
and renamed when complete. If a download is interrupted, running the same
command again resumes partial files and skips finished ones.
.PP
If a track is not available in the chosen format, the best other format is
used for that track. Requests rejected by the server (for example HTTP 403 or
429) are retried with a short backoff.
.PP
Press Ctrl\-C once to stop cleanly, or twice to quit immediately.
.SH TUI KEYS
.TP
type, Enter
Search.
.TP
Esc
Return to the search bar.
.TP
Up/Down, j/k
Move selection.
.TP
Enter / i
Load album info.
.TP
f
Cycle audio format.
.TP
d
Download selected album.
.TP
/
Focus search.
.TP
Ctrl\-U
Clear the search query.
.TP
q
Quit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
ghost-dl
ghost-dl \-\-search celeste
ghost-dl \-d \-f flac minecraft
ghost-dl \-d \-\-tracks 1\-5,9 minecraft
ghost-dl \-o ~/Music https://downloads.khinsider.com/game-soundtracks/album/minecraft
ghost-dl \-\-info persona-5
ghost-dl \-d urls.txt
.EE
.SH FILES
Each album is written to a directory named
.IR "YEAR \- Title (Type)"
under the output directory.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Some downloads failed.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid usage.
.TP
.B 3
Network error.
.TP
.B 4
An album could not be loaded or parsed.
.TP
.B 5
A file could not be read or written.
.TP
.B 130
Interrupted.
